flowchart TD
  A[Verified provider snapshot] --> B{Existing local employee/link?}
  B -- no --> C[Create local projection without app privileges]
  B -- yes --> D[Compare provider-owned fields]
  C --> E[Preserve app role/status/privacy defaults/admin state]
  D --> F{Directorate changed?}
  F -- yes --> G[Close old history interval + append new interval]
  F -- no --> H[Update provider-owned projection]
  G --> H
  E --> I[Audit reconciliation]
  H --> I
  I --> J[Do not rewrite historical task/score attribution]
